# Copy to .env for LOCAL fixture recording only. Never committed; never used by CI.
#
# CI replays committed fixtures and needs no credentials. This key is read only by
# packages/harness/record.ts (Tier B recording, see the capture-harness design doc),
# which drives a real agent to capture genuine AG-UI traffic.
#
# Fixtures recorded this way pass through src/core/jsonl/redact.ts before being
# committed — a real run's completions are real model output, and recording against a
# production upstream could carry real user content. See requirements section 11.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
